{
  "description": "Freshness is measured against the producer stamp, so an expired arrival is refused before it can occupy a reorder slot. Crossing the horizon is a readiness-only transition; a tick inside it invalidates nothing. Retry backoff doubles per consecutive error and clamps at the ceiling.",
